<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōpulso</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. freq. a.
		propello, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to drive back</i>, <i>keep</i> or <i>ward off</i>, <i>to repel</i>, <i>repulse</i> (class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lupos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hostem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 1, 49</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">populum ab ingressione fori,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Phil. 5, 4, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">et aquas hiemis et vapores aestatis propulsare
					radicibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 15, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 12,
				3</span></i>.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ibi resistere ac propulsare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. J. 51, 1</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to ward off</i>, <i>avert</i>, <i>repel</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frigus, famem propulsare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fin. 4, 25, 71</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">periculum capitis legum praesidio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Clu. 52, 144</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suspicionem a se,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Verr. 2, 3, 60, § 140</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bellum ab urbe ac moenibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 3,
					69</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">28, 44</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">morbos exquisitis remediis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 6,
					5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">violentiam vini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					15, 2, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praesidio vim propulsaturus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					10, 8, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
